plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

 summarize the obtained results.
 Overall,
 the relative performance of the compared algorithms depends on both the benchmark function and the problem dimensionality.
 The proposed method demonstrates competitive performance against both the classical metaheuristics:
 GA,
 DE,
 WOA,
 BICCA 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
