\begin_layout Standard
Tables 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "tab:tab16"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "tab:tab17"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

 report the mean and standard deviation of the best objective-function values obtained over 30 independent runs.
 For Dynamic Economic Dispatch 1,
 all compared algorithms converged to very similar objective values with negligible variability,
 indicating the relatively low difficulty of this instance.
 In contrast,
 Dynamic Economic Dispatch 2 exhibited greater variability among the obtained solutions,
 reflecting its higher optimization complexity.
 For the Electricity Transmission Pricing,
 all methods consistently achieved comparable objective values with very small standard deviations,
 demonstrating stable optimization performance across repeated executions.
 Overall,
 the proposed PEAO produced competitive results on all three real-world optimization problems.
\end_layout

