key "key-2"
literal "false"

\end_inset

 and RDEx 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand citep
key "RDEx"
literal "false"

\end_inset

,
 comparative experiments were conducted using the trial-based dominance methodology 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand citep
key "key-1"
literal "false"

\end_inset

.
 Function F2 was excluded from the experimental evaluation due to its reported unstable behavior.
 Consequently,
 all reported results correspond to the remaining 29 benchmark functions 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand citep
key "key-3"
literal "false"

\end_inset

.
 This methodology simultaneously evaluates solution quality and convergence speed through the computation of U-scores.
